      * MQSTM    - TRIGGER MESSAGE, STAND-IN WRITTEN FOR THIS ESTATE
           05  MQS-TM-STRUCID         PIC X(4) VALUE 'TM  '.
           05  MQS-TM-VERSION         PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 1.
           05  MQS-TM-QNAME           PIC X(48).
           05  MQS-TM-PROCESS         PIC X(48).
           05  MQS-TM-TRIGDATA        PIC X(64).
           05  MQS-TM-APPTYPE         PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
           05  MQS-TM-APPLID          PIC X(256).
           05  MQS-TM-ENVDATA         PIC X(128).
           05  MQS-TM-USERDATA        PIC X(128).
